    <briefdescription>
<para>design configuration reader </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A class to configure a design hierarchy using a JSON input file. It reads a file and and stores its values into a CCI broker. It can apply the value also to sc_attribute once the design is installed. </para>
